{"id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-so-quantifier-semantics.md","title":"二阶量词语义","display":"df-so-quantifier-semantics — 二阶量词语义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","aliases":["29-df-so-quantifier-semantics"],"display":"df-so-quantifier-semantics — 二阶量词语义","depends_on":["[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-second-order]]","[[29-df-term-interpretation]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 7.1, p.113, DjVu scan 128","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-quantifier-semantics — 二阶量词语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 7.1, p.113, DjVu scan 128"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathrm{RAssgn}(A)\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathrm{RAssgn}(A)\\)</span> 为以下构造的关系变量赋值，其函数定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelVar}\\)</span>，每个变量的值符合其元数标签。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_k\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\tau\">\\(P\\in\\tau\\)</span> 是关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\)</span>；项值取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76bbac386a4be5a3\" href=\"?note=76bbac386a4be5a3\" title=\"29-df-term-interpretation\">29-df-term-interpretation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[R\\mapsto S]\">\\(\\eta[R\\mapsto S]\\)</span> 仅更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq|A|^k\">\\(S\\subseteq|A|^k\\)</span>；个体赋值更新见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>语法及自由变量递归见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>，所有构造子由本条的明确递归解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\)</span> 为本条二阶公式；布尔构造子及全称个体量词均由以下递归直接解释，不要求预先作自然语言约定的脱糖。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RAssgn}(A)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\geq1}\\mathcal P(|A|^j)\\right)^{\\mathrm{RelVar}}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_k\\;\\eta(R)\\subseteq|A|^k\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RAssgn}(A)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{j\\geq1}\\mathcal P(|A|^j)\\right)^{\\mathrm{RelVar}}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_k\\;\\eta(R)\\subseteq|A|^k\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta[R\\mapsto S](Q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}S,&amp;Q=R,\\\\\\eta(Q),&amp;Q\\ne R,\\end{cases}\\qquad Q\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta[R\\mapsto S](Q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}S,&amp;Q=R,\\\\\\eta(Q),&amp;Q\\ne R,\\end{cases}\\qquad Q\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}t=u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t^A[\\beta]=u^A[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}t=u\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t^A[\\beta]=u^A[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}P(\\bar t)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in P^A,\\qquad(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}R(\\bar t)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in\\eta(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}P(\\bar t)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in P^A,\\qquad(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}R(\\bar t)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\bar t^A[\\beta]\\in\\eta(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\neg\\psi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\neg\\psi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\land\\chi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\land(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\chi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\land\\chi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\land(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\chi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;(A,\\beta[a/x],\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in|A|\\;(A,\\beta[a/x],\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\exists R\\,\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists S\\subseteq|A|^k\\;(A,\\beta,\\eta[R\\mapsto S])\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\exists R\\,\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists S\\subseteq|A|^k\\;(A,\\beta,\\eta[R\\mapsto S])\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\forall R\\,\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall S\\subseteq|A|^k\\;(A,\\beta,\\eta[R\\mapsto S])\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\forall R\\,\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall S\\subseteq|A|^k\\;(A,\\beta,\\eta[R\\mapsto S])\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{RAssgn}(A)\\;(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{RAssgn}(A)\\;(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\top,\\qquad\\neg((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\top,\\qquad\\neg((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\lor(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\phi\\lor\\psi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\lor(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\to(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\to(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi)\\leftrightarrow((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}(\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi)\\leftrightarrow((A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\forall x\\,\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;(A,\\beta[a/x],\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,\\beta,\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\forall x\\,\\phi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a\\in|A|\\;(A,\\beta[a/x],\\eta)\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 7.1，印刷页 113，扫描页 128。补齐关系变量原子、个体量词和布尔子句，使二阶满足不再只有两个悬空的二阶量词子句。对闭句，按公式归纳得到赋值无关性，因此最后的句子满足缩写有确定意义。</p>\n<p>本轮修正关系赋值的层级：原来的按元数k作索引的函数族不能直接用关系变量R调用。RAssgn(A)现在给出以全部关系变量作定义域的单个函数，并逐元数限制值域；单坐标更新有显式分支，句子满足的赋值量词同步迁移。全部语义子句仍按有限公式树递归。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-second-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"76bbac386a4be5a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term-interpretation"